TIP:  The intro consists of the chords from the first and last lines of the verse.  To go from the (D) to (D-) to (G) just lift off your index finger from the 3rd string for one count before moving on to the (G).
 
TIP:  For (Fadd9) hold the (F) and add your pinky to the 1st string of the 3rd fret.

TIP:  The instrumental bridge is a bit of a mess.  Just move along with the chords.  (D#) is (D) moved up one string with your pinky added to the 4th string/5th fret.                


